{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is mission-completion third-person action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Combat is similar to TPS, but different&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is because you cannot use AIM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, you can simultaneously fire a shotgun that shoots in front of your character and an automatic tracking missile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The behavior of the missiles changes depending on the character's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot in various directions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can use special  moves by consuming &quot;EN&quot;, which increases when </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >missiles are hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Nivoz, a fellow character&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, the mysterious canned robot who follows Juju around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz is a mysterious canned robot that follows Juju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch control to Nivoz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use Nivoz's bottomless durability to scout for new locations or use him as a shield...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only while operating Nivoz, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >special shots can be activated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of special shots </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will increase as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each ability to your advantage and win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Story&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juju, an alien robot living on the planet Hawkia, has had a series of mishaps since the day she met </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, a robot that looks like a canned food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge building was thrust into the town where she lives, and  unfamiliar robots began to run amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the prototype anti-drone gun &quot;W-BLOOM&quot; in her hand, Juju's journey to find a safe place began!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2347630?t=1757668411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757668411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347630/9bb5a4e118861273c1df6ea3a90ec6500e7a8335/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757668411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347630/9bb5a4e118861273c1df6ea3a90ec6500e7a8335/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757668411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3215780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is mission-completion third-person action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Combat is similar to TPS, but different&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is because you cannot use AIM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, you can simultaneously fire a shotgun that shoots in front of your character and an automatic tracking missile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The behavior of the missiles changes depending on the character's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot in various directions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can use special  moves by consuming &quot;EN&quot;, which increases when </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >missiles are hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Nivoz, a fellow character&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, the mysterious canned robot who follows Juju around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz is a mysterious canned robot that follows Juju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch control to Nivoz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use Nivoz's bottomless durability to scout for new locations or use him as a shield...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only while operating Nivoz, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >special shots can be activated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of special shots </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will increase as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each ability to your advantage and win the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt;Story&lt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juju, an alien robot living on the planet Hawkia, has had a series of mishaps since the day she met </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nivoz, a robot that looks like a canned food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge building was thrust into the town where she lives, and  unfamiliar robots began to run amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the prototype anti-drone gun &quot;W-BLOOM&quot; in her hand, Juju's journey to find a safe place began!</p>","developers":["morning glows"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347630/99138a2f66205210a64ac8cc7a659f9b04d31a0d/header.jpg?t=1757668411","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2347630/1654309265/2444e4f3bc49e99b62a320fa5ec0ab674d4bcdb9/1752321095/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753904747","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2347630/1654309265/2444e4f3bc49e99b62a320fa5ec0ab674d4bcdb9/1752321095/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753904747","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2347630/1654309265/2444e4f3bc49e99b62a320fa5ec0ab674d4bcdb9/1752321095/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753904747","id":257168128,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168128/movie480.mp4?t=1753904747","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store